  unitName: Informant Elise
  unitId: 10744
  unitNumber: 1109
  description: A mock Unit based on Elise. Elise's abilities as a Summoner grew immensely
    during her time as vice-commander, until injuries from an altercation with a
    certain demon forced her to retire. Noah, the commander of the Silver Knights,
    then began having problems with his men after Elise's absence, which only served
    to remind him of the importance of her role in the division. Unfortunately, this
    mock Unit is based on Elise's currently diminished abilities, as Noel believes
    that one's real power can only be claimed by oneself.
  summonDesc: Who do you take me for?<br>I won't let neither you nor Noel<br>get
    away with anything weird!
  fusionDesc: I don't know what this is,<br>but it feels nice!<br>It's like I'm becoming
    stronger...<br>I feel like I can work harder now!
  evoDesc: Oh, it looks like I've changed!<br>And maybe got a bit stronger, too.<br>I
    think I may be able to help now!
  element: 1
  rarity: 4
